* Take care of the Creed, for the Creed will take care of you

  - Always get up the moment you wake up.
  - Always fold your blanket as the first thing you do right after you wake up.
  - Only disable the QRAlarm using the QR code.
  - Never ever miss your MRs and ERs.
  - Never ever touch your phone until you finish your MR.
  - Never ever touch your phone during MR and ER.

  - Only spend time on youtube if it is absolutely necessary.
  - Never spent more than 30 minutes on youtube a day.
  - Only use tubular for youtube, and never ever touch the official clients.
  - Social media are Skinner's boxes, so never ever doom scroll.

  - Never lie down on the bed unless you are going to sleep.

  - Never ever shit talk.
  - Never ever speak in a group, you talk to people one to one.
  - You don't spent time in groups, you are good on your own.
  - You don't have to fake a smile, if you don't make eye contact.

  - Today will be worse than yesterday, and tomorrow will be worse than today, so
    today is the least worst day you will ever going to have, so give it your fullest.
  - Always remember, every time you feel bad or feel like a shit, it's just your natural
    response to the external world, and you can actually control that response.

  - Eat 5 times a day.
  - Always eat on time.
  - Focus on eating while you eat, nothing else can occupy your mind.

  - Go for run at least once a week.

  - Always schedule the day in.
  - Never ever trail off from the scheduling no matter what.
  - Always give your 100 percent and some at the task at hand, nothing else matters.

  - Read something every day.

  - Always wash your cloths on time.

  - Be sober in all the affairs.
  - Never get addicted to anything.
  - Think before you type / act.

  - Ones who keep the Creed, will be taken care of, by the Creed.
  - So never ever break the Creed.
